flowchart TB
  F[Filename claim] --> V[Internal title/author/year/DOI]
  V --> H[SHA-256]
  H --> S{validation_status}
  S -->|verified_identity| R[Register source]
  S -->|duplicate/reject| X[Do not ingest as claimed]
  R --> EX[Page extracts]
  EX --> G[Activation gate]
  G -->|fail| Q[Qualitative only / inactive]
  G -->|pass| N[Numerical density param]
